Complete local PHP example; the app itself does not execute it:
```php
<?php
declare(strict_types=1);
interface Formatter { public function format(string $text): string; }
class Plain implements Formatter {
    public function format(string $text): string { return $text; }
}
function show(Formatter $formatter): void { echo $formatter->format('PHP'), "\n"; }
show(new Plain());
```

